{"3136740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alchemy", "steam_appid": 3136740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy is a 3D Puzzle platformer taking place at Chemical Laboratories, a company that discovered a powerfull substance capable of giving superhuman characteristics. Chemical labs will be hosting an event for investors were a gateway to another reality will be opened, what could go wrong? Find your way out trough chambers and try to understand what is going on at this bizarre shuffle of what chemical labs used to be. Alchemy introduces a new way of solving puzzles centered on movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 20 Main chambers + extra levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 7-10 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > •  A storyline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique mechanics.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy is a 3D Puzzle platformer taking place at Chemical Laboratories, a company that discovered a powerfull substance capable of giving superhuman characteristics. Chemical labs will be hosting an event for investors were a gateway to another reality will be opened, what could go wrong? Find your way out trough chambers and try to understand what is going on at this bizarre shuffle of what chemical labs used to be. Alchemy introduces a new way of solving puzzles centered on movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 20 Main chambers + extra levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 7-10 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > •  A storyline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique mechanics.</p>", "short_description": "Discover what lies beyond our reality with Alchemy. A portal-like experience that will challenge you to think with potions while trying to solve the mysteries of this